[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 2. **Runtime options / modes / flags.** None. No global state, no init call, no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    setter, no `#ifdef`, no environment lookup, no struct the caller can
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    configure. `grep -n "#if\|#ifdef\|static [^i]" c_src/src/lib.c` finds no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    mutable module state — every `static` is a function.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 3. **The single input axis: `pfcn`.** Three separate `switch (pfcn)` statements
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    branch on it, with these distinct case partitions:
