[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    160[0m:[38;5;10m[49m }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    161[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    162[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Deterministic PRNG (SplitMix64) so every randomised row is reproducible from
